<title>POLAND: Budimex wins PLN 32.4 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Budimex wins PLN 32.4 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction firm Budimex SA has signed a 32.4-million-zloty contract to modernise a dormitory for the Warszawska Politechnika engineering school, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Budimex said it would have 16 months to complete the project.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
